===Etymology 1===
From Proto-{{Ural.|fi}} ''*karke'', itself an onomatopoeic word. Cognates include Estonian {{term|kurg}} and Northern Sami {{term|guorga}}.<ref>Häkkinen, Kaisa (2005): ''Nykysuomen etymologinen sanakirja'', Juva: WSOY. ISBN 951-0-27108-X</ref>

====Noun====
{{fi-noun|kur|type=arki}}

# [[crane]] (''Grus grus'')
# a member of the family [[Gruidae]]

